<title>USA: Competitive sales total $33 mln Monday, Sept 30.</title>
<headline>Competitive sales total $33 mln Monday, Sept 30.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled competitive bond sales total $33.3 million in 4 offerings for Monday, September 30, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>The largest issue is a $22.5 million New Hope-Solebury School District, Pa., issue at 1130 EDT.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
